  "caveat": "Cases and runbooks are generated (docs/GENERATOR.md). The generator sets `deflectable` from category, severity and coin flips, then copies a runbook phrase into deflectable descriptions; non-deflectable cases carry a stock phrase that is also a runbook's first symptom. Text matching therefore recovers the 'a runbook covers this symptom' precondition and cannot see the severity gate or the coins. These numbers measure the matcher against that ceiling, not whether any real case could have been deflected."
